     3076   on ctrl-f of sch-corr-date in frame Dialog-Frame
     3077   do:
     3078     if (can-query (self, "sensitive")
     3079        and
     3080        self :sensitive = true
     3081        )
     3082     or (can-query (self, "read-only")
     3083        and
