     3151       apply "ctrl-b":U to sch-corr-date in frame Dialog-Frame .
     3152     END.
     3153     ON CHOOSE OF MENU-ITEM m-ed-date21-2 in menu m-ed-date21 DO:
     3154       apply "ctrl-d":U to sch-corr-date in frame Dialog-Frame .
     3155     END.
     3156     ON CHOOSE OF MENU-ITEM m-ed-date21-3 in menu m-ed-date21 DO:
     3157       apply "ctrl-e":U to sch-corr-date in frame Dialog-Frame .
     3158     END.
     3159     ON CHOOSE OF MENU-ITEM m-ed-date21-4 in menu m-ed-date21 DO:
