     5559         X_c-gds-hist.corr-user-db-num
     5560         X_c-gds-hist.host-code
     5561         X_c-gds-hist.obj-type + string(X_c-gds-hist.obj-code) @ v-obj
     5562         with FRAME HistoryList .
     5563     DOWN STREAM PrnLibStream 1 with FRAME HistoryList  .
     5564     assign
     5565     accum-count = accum-count + 1
     5566     .
     5567     GET next br-gds-hist.
     5568   END.
     5569   UNDERLINE  STREAM PrnLibStream
     5570   X_c-gds-hist.gds-code
     5571   v-action-chr
     5572   v-gds-name
     5573   v-artic
     5574   v-prod
     5575   v-subject-chr
     5576   X_c-gds-hist.is-news
     5577   v-source-type
     5578   X_c-gds-hist.source-ref
     5579   X_c-gds-hist.corr-date
     5580   v-upd-time
     5581   X_c-gds-hist.corr-user-name
     5582   X_c-gds-hist.corr-user-db-num
     5583   X_c-gds-hist.host-code
     5584   v-obj
     5585   with FRAME HistoryList .
     5586   DISPLAY STREAM PrnLibStream
     5587   "ИТОГО"  @ X_c-gds-hist.gds-code
     5588   string(accum-count)  @ v-action-chr
     5589   with frame HistoryList.
     5590   HIDE  STREAM PrnLibStream FRAME BottomFrame .
     5591   HIDE  STREAM PrnLibStream FRAME CheckList.
     5592   output  STREAM PrnLibStream CLOSE.
