     5594   run prn-lib-prn-file in this-procedure (
     5595                                             input parparentproc
     5596                                             ,input 8
     5597                                             ).
     5598   reposition br-gds-hist to recid v-doc-rec no-error.
     5599   apply "entry" to br-gds-hist in frame Dialog-Frame.
     5600   END PROCEDURE.
